OBSERVATION: message is clipped at the popup border; visible text ends mid-word
  ('... has 2 ac'). On a 120-column pty the same message renders in full
  (see regression-S5-M-tui.log). Cause: ui/components.rs::render_tips renders
  into centered_rect(50,18) with a non-wrapping Paragraph; CJK prefixes consume
  2 cells/char, so long S9/G3 error tips exceed a 50%-width popup on 80-col terminals.
Severity: P2 (display only; DB/config behaviour correct; count digit '2' still visible).
